0,0.02,0.029,0.005,0.045,0.05,0.005,0.016,0.101,0.0,0.027,0.063,0.171,0.023,0.006,0.372,0.032,0.03,0.002,0.025,-0.014,0.046,0.0,0.023,0.101,0.041,0.374,0.021,0.103,0.008,0.003,0.375,0.061,0.005,0.663]}},"analyst":{"s1":{"fr":{"lead":"{T:home:Sub} gagne 2–0. Petit cambriolage : {T:home:sub} gagne avec 1,77 xG seulement, face à 2,71. Le réalisme a battu le volume.","keys":["{T:away:Sub} a eu le ballon (73 %) et a perdu : la possession, c'est comme un abonnement à la salle, encore faut-il s'en servir.","Grosses occasions (xG ≥ 0,30) : 2 pour {T:home:sub}, 1 pour {T:away:sub}.","Mitraillage en règle : 29 tirs pour {T:away:sub}, contre 12."],"impact":"L'homme du match selon nos craies : Son Heung-Min (1 but, 1,18 xG, 0,11 xT). Les xG mesurent les occasions, pas le sang-froid. Ce soir-là, le sang-froid a gagné."},"en":{"lead":"{T:home:sub} win 2–0. A minor heist: {T:home:sub} win with just 1.77 xG against 2.71. Ruthlessness beat volume.","keys":["{T:away:sub} had the ball (73%) and lost: possession is like a gym membership, you still have to use it.","Big chances (xG ≥ 0.30): 2 for {T:home:sub}, 1 for {T:away:sub}.","Shooting gallery: 29 shots for {T:away:sub}, against 12."],"impact":"Man of the match, by our chalk: Son Heung-Min (1 goal, 1.18 xG, 0.11 xT). xG measure chances, not composure. That night, composure won."}},"s2":{"fr":{"lead":"Sur la feuille, {T:home:sub} était en 4-4-2. Sur le terrain, avec le ballon, ça ressemblait plutôt à un 3-4-3. {T:away:Sub} annonçait un 4-2-3-1 et a attaqué en 3-4-3 : la composition d'équipe, c'est un point de départ, pas un contrat.","keys":["{T:home:Sub} change de peau selon la phase : 3-4-3 avec le ballon, 4-2-3-1 sans.","Le couloir préféré {T:home:de} : l'axe (27 % des touches).","Le couloir préféré {T:away:de} : l'axe (27 % des touches).","{T:away:Sub} a passé du temps chez l'adversaire : 43 % de ses touches dans le dernier tiers."],"impact":"Le plan {T:home:de} a tenu jusqu'au bout. Les positions moyennes ne disent pas tout, mais elles disent qui occupait le terrain."},"en":{"lead":"On paper, {T:home:sub} lined up in a 4-4-2. On the pitch, in possession, it looked more like a 3-4-3. {T:away:sub} announced a 4-2-3-1 and attacked in a 3-4-3: a team sheet is a starting point, not a contract.","keys":["{T:home:sub} changes shape by phase: 3-4-3 with the ball, 4-2-3-1 without.","{T:home:pos} favourite lane: the centre (27% of touches).","{T:away:pos} favourite lane: the centre (27% of touches).","{T:away:sub} camped in the opponent's half: 43% of touches in the final third."],"impact":"{T:home:pos} plan held to the end. Average positions do not say everything, but they say who owned the space."}},"s3":{"fr":{"lead":"Le pressing, c'était {T:away:sub} : un PPDA de 15,2, contre 19,6 en face. Comprendre : moins de passes laissées à l'adversaire avant de lui sauter dessus.","keys":["Réaction à la perte comparable : 20 % et 25 % des ballons perdus récupérés en moins de 5 s.","8 récupérations hautes pour {T:away:sub} (ballons perdus par l'adversaire dans ses 35 derniers mètres) : autant de départs d'actions à deux pas du but.","{T:away:Sub} a contre-pressé fort : 25 % de ses pressions tombent dans les 5 s qui suivent une perte (moyenne du tournoi : 19 %)."],"impact":"Presser ne suffit pas : encore faut-il que les ballons récupérés se transforment. Ici, ils ne l'ont pas fait."},"en":{"lead":"The pressing came from {T:away:sub}: a PPDA of 15.2, against 19.6 for the opponents. Translation: fewer passes allowed before jumping on the ball.","keys":["Similar reaction to losing the ball: 20% and 25% won back within 5 s.","8 high regains for {T:away:sub} (balls lost by the opponent in their own 35 metres): that many attacks starting next to goal.","Heavy counter-pressing from {T:away:sub}: 25% of pressures come within 5 s of a loss (tournament average: 19%)."],"impact":"Pressing is not enough: the regained balls still have to turn into something. Here, they did not."}},"s4":{"fr":{"lead":"Deux équipes proches sur l'axe (+0,23 et −0,17) : pas de choc de styles, plutôt un duel de mêmes recettes.","keys":["Le carrefour du réseau {T:home:de} : Lee Jae-Sung, impliqué dans 44 passes entre titulaires.","Le carrefour du réseau {T:away:de} : Toni Kroos, impliqué dans 184 passes entre titulaires."],"impact":"À style égal, c'est l'exécution qui tranche : avantage {T:home:bare}."},"en":{"lead":"Two teams close on the axis (+0.23 and −0.17): no clash of styles, more of a mirror match.","keys":["The hub of {T:home:pos} network: Lee Jae-Sung, involved in 44 passes between starters.","The hub of {T:away:pos} network: Toni Kroos, involved in 184 passes between starters."],"impact":"With similar styles, execution decides: advantage {T:home:sub}."}},"s5":{"fr":{"lead":"Perdre le ballon coûtait plus cher à {T:away:sub} : 4 tirs adverses en transition (1,04 xG), contre 4 pour l'autre camp.","keys":["But encaissé en transition par {T:away:sub} : 96'. Le repli arrivait en retard.","Sans 360, on ne voit pas les courses de repli : seuls les tirs concédés racontent l'histoire."],"impact":"Le match s'est en partie joué là : mieux gérer ses pertes, c'est souvent mieux gérer le score."},"en":{"lead":"Losing the ball cost {T:away:sub} more: 4 opponent shots in transition (1.04 xG), against 4 the other way.","keys":["Goal conceded in transition by {T:away:sub}: 96'. The recovery run came too late.","Without 360, recovery runs are invisible: only the shots conceded tell the story."],"impact":"Part of the match was decided right there: managing your losses is often managing the scoreline."}},"s6":{"fr":{"lead":"Sans 360, on mesure l'attention reçue : Koo Ja-Cheol a subi 6,17 actions défensives de plus que la normale pour 10 touches.","keys":["Moon Seon-Min ({T:home:bare}) : +3,94.","Son Heung-Min ({T:home:bare}) : +2,15.","Jang Hyun-Soo ({T:home:bare}) : +1,97.","À l'autre bout, Thomas Müller (−2,02) a joué dans un relatif anonymat : parfois, c'est exactement ce qu'on cherche."],"impact":"Koo Ja-Cheol n'a pas marqué, mais en attirant les regards il a ouvert la porte à d'autres : Son Heung-Min et Kim Young-Gwon ont fini décisifs. C'est ça, la gravité."},"en":{"lead":"Without 360, we measure attention received: Koo Ja-Cheol drew 6.17 more defensive actions than normal per 10 touches.","keys":["Moon Seon-Min ({T:home:sub}): +3.94.","Son Heung-Min ({T:home:sub}): +2.15.","Jang Hyun-Soo ({T:home:sub}): +1.97.","At the other end, Thomas Müller (−2.02) played in relative peace: sometimes that is exactly the point."],"impact":"Koo Ja-Cheol did not score, but by drawing eyes he opened the door for others: Son Heung-Min and Kim Young-Gwon ended up decisive. That is gravity."}},"s7":{"fr":{"lead":"Menace créée balle au pied et à la passe (xT) : 1,28 pour {T:home:sub}, 4,32 pour {T:away:sub}. Le meilleur créateur : Joshua Kimmich, 1,01 xT à lui seul (23 % de la menace de son équipe).","keys":["Geste le plus menaçant {T:home:de} : une passe signée Lee Yong à la 55e minute (+0,14 xT).","Geste le plus menaçant {T:away:de} : une passe signée Thomas Müller à la 99e minute (+0,37 xT)."],"impact":"{T:away:Sub} a créé plus de menace, mais {T:home:sub} a converti la sienne (1,77 xG au final). Amener le ballon près du but, c'est la moitié du travail."},"en":{"lead":"Threat created by passes and carries (xT): 1.28 for {T:home:sub}, 4.32 for {T:away:sub}. Top creator: Joshua Kimmich, 1.01 xT on his own (23% of his team's threat).","keys":["{T:home:pos} most dangerous action: a pass by Lee Yong in minute 55 (+0.14 xT).","{T:away:pos} most dangerous action: a pass by Thomas Müller in minute 99 (+0.37 xT)."],"impact":"{T:away:sub} created more threat, but {T:home:sub} converted theirs (1.77 xG in the end). Getting the ball near goal is only half the job."}},"s8":{"fr":{"lead":"Sur l'ensemble de la compétition, Toni Kroos pointe au 1er rang des milieux (sur 123). Ce match, c'était aussi une vitrine.","keys":["Mats Hummels ({T:away:bare}) : 1er des défenseurs centraux sur 40.","Mesut Özil ({T:away:bare}) : 4e des milieux sur 123.","Son Heung-Min ({T:home:bare}) : 3e des attaquants sur 68.","Joueurs dans le top 5 de leur poste : 2 pour {T:home:sub}, 4 pour {T:away:sub}."],"impact":"Le collectif a battu les individualités : {T:home:sub} gagne avec moins de joueurs au sommet des classements."},"en":{"lead":"Across the whole competition, Toni Kroos ranks 1st among midfielders (out of 123). This match was also a showcase.","keys":["Mats Hummels ({T:away:sub}): 1st of 40 centre-backs.","Mesut Özil ({T:away:sub}): 4th of 123 midfielders.","Son Heung-Min ({T:home:sub}): 3rd of 68 forwards.","Players in their position's top 5: 2 for {T:home:sub}, 4 for {T:away:sub}."],"impact":"The collective beat the individuals: {T:home:sub} won with fewer players at the top of the rankings."}},"s9":{"fr":{"lead":"Un sosie pour Son Heung-Min dans les chiffres ? Gareth Bale ({TN:Real Madrid}, finales de Ligue des champions), avec 94 % de similarité.","keys":["Jang Hyun-Soo ↔ Majid Hosseini (Coupe du monde 2022, 96 %).","Lee Yong ↔ Kenneth Omeruo (Coupe du monde 2018, 95 %).","Toni Kroos ↔ T. Kroos (Euro 2016, 93 %)."],"impact":"Un jumeau n'est pas un clone : la similarité compare des profils par 90 minutes (tirs, passes, xT, défense…), pas le talent. Mais ça donne des idées au mercato."},"en":{"lead":"If Son Heung-Min had a lookalike in the numbers, it would be Gareth Bale ({TN:Real Madrid}, Champions League finals): 94% similar.","keys":["Jang Hyun-Soo ↔ Majid Hosseini (2022 World Cup, 96%).","Lee Yong ↔ Kenneth Omeruo (2018 World Cup, 95%).","Toni Kroos ↔ T. Kroos (Euro 2016, 93%)."],"impact":"A twin is not a clone: similarity compares per-90 profiles (shots, passes, xT, defending…), not talent. Still, it gives transfer ideas."}}}}